# When metadata contains conflicting timestamps, list all values (preference)

Standing user preference: When metadata contains conflicting timestamps, list all values and flag the inconsistency explicitly; never select one value as authoritative.

## Conventions
- When metadata contains conflicting timestamps, list all values and flag the inconsistency explicitly; never select one value as authoritative.

